error[E0480]: a `blocking` extern can't take or give `Ctx`, a pinned handle: it runs on a helper thread
  --> tests/programs/c/pinned/e0480.la:3:33
  |
3 | extern blocking fun ctx_load(c: Ctx): i64;
  |                                 ^^^
  |
  = help: a pinned handle stays on the thread that made it; drop `blocking`, so the call runs on the task's own thread

